// The starter roster data (moved out of components/NavitarShowcase
// 2026-11-16 — blank-screen fix). NavitarShowcase imports
// NavidexStage (for the 3D stage view) while NavidexStage read this
// array at module top level to build its stage roster: a circular
// import. Whichever module webpack evaluated second dereferenced
// `sampleNavitars` before the other's const had initialized —
// "Cannot access 'N_' before initialization" during bundle
// evaluation, React never mounted, and a fresh load rendered a
// completely blank page. Data lives here now, in a module with no
// component imports, so the cycle is gone for good. NavitarShowcase
// re-exports both names for its existing importers.
