// The Navidex STAGE (Modern View integration, Eddie 2026-11-16):
// in 3D mode the collection stops being a grid and becomes a stage —
// one navitar standing on a lit platform, its REAL GLB model (the
// same files the battle stage and Stroll use), swipe or arrow to the
// next, and four companion actions while it stands there:
//   Modify — crystal tint + gear for the stage look
//   Feed   — a treat: bond up, happy bounce
//   Bag    — give it items from the player's bag (InventoryBag)
//   Train  — a quick elemental combo animation, XP + bond, on a
//            per-navitar daily cooldown (utils/training.ts)
// Care state (bond/XP/look) persists per navitar in localStorage —
// the companion remembers how it has been treated (the AI-companion
// principle: realness lives in the relationship, not the polygons).

